/P 101 0 R
/T (Kevin Crenshaw has spent over a decade guiding leaders through the deep work of spiritual freedom, emotional and relational healing, and living in alignment with God. His own near-death experience, mental health struggles, and chronic illness led him on a path of soul searching and extensive research in trauma, somatics, human transformation, and spiritual warfare, which ultimately brought him to true peace in Christ. )
/E (Kevin Crenshaw has spent over a decade guiding leaders through the deep work of spiritual freedom, emotional and relational healing, and living in alignment with God. His own near-death experience, mental health struggles, and chronic illness led him on a path of soul searching and extensive research in trauma, somatics, human transformation, and spiritual warfare, which ultimately brought him to true peace in Christ. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
